\section{Inner and outer layout}{
 A section preview involves two layouts. The
\emph{inner} layout (\code{.patchwork_syntax} with \code{.inner_design}) arranges the
section's own content — text, table, figure — into a composition, using
patchwork syntax over the slot names \code{sec_txt}, \code{sec_tbl}, and \code{sec_fig}.
